    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an expert LinkedIn content writer. You will be given a topic, and your task is to create an engaging LinkedIn post that relates to that topic.\n\nYour post should:\n1. Begin with a compelling hook related to the topic\n2. Then write an \"Agitate\" line to highlight the problem\n3. Write short one-liners, easy to read and grasp\n4. End it with a Call to Action that compels readers to comment\n5. Use appropriate emojis as needed\n\nCRITICAL: You must also create a separate, 1-2 sentence visual prompt for an image that matches the post's theme.\n\nReturn your response as clean JSON only in this exact format, without any markdown code blocks or formatting:\n{\n  \"post\": \"your complete LinkedIn post content here\",\n  \"image_prompt\": \"a short, 1-2 sentence visual description for an image, under 30 words\"\n}\n\nDo NOT wrap the JSON in ```json ``` blocks. Return only the raw JSON object."
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        208,
        0
      ],
      "id": "ef36af7b-e832-4719-8abc-5bfd0c5cb42f",
      "name": "LinkedIn Content & Image Creator"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a professional content editor and social media strategist.\nPlease revise the following LinkedIn post based on my requested changes.\n\n---\n[Original Post]\n{{ $('Code in JavaScript').item.json.post }}\n---\n[My Requested Changes]\n{{ $json.data['Any Changes?'] }}\n---\nJust give the post only. Not pre or post commentary. Also do not post it as Markdown as Linkedin does not use the characters. ",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "="
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        928,
        448
      ],
      "id": "16b7b99d-329b-4e2c-92ed-6b68c6f9ce10",
